  "summary": "Malicious code in @or-sdk/password (npm)",
  "details": "The package runs a preinstall hook (node setup.mjs) that downloads the Bun runtime and uses it to execute a 727KB heavily-obfuscated bundled script (math_init.js) containing a custom string-array decoder. The package also depends on @or-sdk/sdk-api, a sibling package in the same namespace. Installing this package executes the large obfuscated payload at install time.",
